{"ID":"20240206115212-pc0kdwv","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206115212-pc0kdwv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115212-pc0kdwv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115225-eo1ghqb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115217-uz74rjd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115225-eo1ghqb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:164,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:164\u0026#125;","title":"牡荆叶","type":"doc","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206115225-eo1ghqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115225-eo1ghqb","updated":"20240206115228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江苏、江西、安徽、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t本品为掌状复叶，小叶5片或3片，披针形或椭圆状披针形，中间小叶长510cm，宽24cm，两侧小叶依次渐小，先端渐尖，基部楔形，边缘具粗锯齿；上表面绿色，下表面淡绿色，两面沿叶脉有短茸毛，嫩叶下表面毛较密；总叶柄长2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6cm，有一浅沟槽，密被灰白色茸毛。气芳香，味辛微苦。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，平。\n【功效】\t解表化湿，祛痰平喘；解毒，祛风解表，除湿，杀虫，止痛。主治伤风感冒，咳嗽哮喘；胃痛；腹痛；暑湿泻痢；脚气肿胀；风疹瘙痒；脚癣；乳痈肿痛；蛇虫咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206115217-uz74rjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115217-uz74rjd","updated":"20240206115217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206115217-zira2e9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717095342-3k8y3oo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095342-3k8y3oo","updated":"20240717095359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 337px;","style":"width: 327px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 3-20240717095359-n0lbr3d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 327px;\" parent-style=\"width: 337px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 747px;","style":"width: 737px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 2-20240717095342-l7drpv8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 737px;\" parent-style=\"width: 747px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717100519-m8ovzz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717100519-m8ovzz3","updated":"20240717100714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 337px;","style":"width: 327px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 9-20240717100503-hcays06.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 327px;\" parent-style=\"width: 337px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 336px;","style":"width: 326px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 10-20240717100629-yol05kw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 326px;\" parent-style=\"width: 336px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 337px;","style":"width: 327px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 11-20240717100714-33h1n1k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 327px;\" parent-style=\"width: 337px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717100227-mdzppuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717100227-mdzppuc","updated":"20240717100411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 423px;","style":"width: 413px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 6-20240717100227-p519lnf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 413px;\" parent-style=\"width: 423px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 423px;","style":"width: 413px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 7-20240717100312-zk0yd6r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 413px;\" parent-style=\"width: 423px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 423px;","style":"width: 413px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 8-20240717100411-sr683tq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 413px;\" parent-style=\"width: 423px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240717095313-fpy7h20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095313-fpy7h20","updated":"20240717095621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 708px;","style":"width: 698px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 1-20240717095313-cjz14pt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 698px;\" parent-style=\"width: 708px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 357px;","style":"width: 347px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 5-20240717095621-17og39t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 347px;\" parent-style=\"width: 357px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717100109-dm9y1fo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717100109-dm9y1fo","updated":"20240717100930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 777px;","style":"width: 767px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 13-20240717100920-9e7k5b4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 767px;\" parent-style=\"width: 777px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 333px;","style":"width: 323px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牡荆 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牡荆 12-20240717100817-g4y17s2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 323px;\" parent-style=\"width: 333px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717095136-y701b78","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717095136-y701b78"}},{"ID":"20240717095137-n91s6qq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-n91s6qq","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-j36nmv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-j36nmv2","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆，生河间、南阳、冤句三谷，或平寿、都乡高岸上及田野中。今眉州、蜀州及近京亦有之，此即作棰杖者，俗名黄荆是也。枝茎坚劲，作科不为蔓生，故称牡。叶如蓖麻，更疏瘦；花红作穗；实细而黄，如麻子大；或云即小荆也。八月、九月采实，阴干。此有青赤二种，以青者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-2zval3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-2zval3k","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谨按陶隐居《登真隐诀》云∶荆木之华、叶，通神见鬼精。注云∶寻荆有三种。直云荆木，即是今可作棰杖者，叶香，亦有花、子，子不入药。方术则用牡荆，牡荆子入药，北方人略无识其木者。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-qf2nmqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-qf2nmqb","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《六甲阴符》说∶一名羊栌，一名空疏，理白而中虚。断植即生。今羊栌斫植亦生，而花实微细。非药家所用者。天监三年，上将合神仙饭，奉敕论牡荆曰∶荆，花白多子，子粗大，历历疏生，不过三、两茎，多不能圆，或褊或异，或多似竹节。叶与余荆不殊。蜂多采牡荆，牡荆汁冷而甜。余荆被烧，则烟火气苦。牡荆体慢汁实，烟火不入其中，主治心风第一。于时即远近寻觅，遂不值，犹用荆叶。今之所有者云∶崔元亮《集验方》，治腰脚蒸法，取荆叶不限多少，蒸令熟热，置于瓮中，其下着火，温之，以病人置于叶中，剩着叶，盖须臾当汗出药中，旋旋吃饭，稍倦即止，便以绵衣盖避风，仍进葱豉酒，及豆酒，并得以瘥为度。又取此荆茎条，截，于火上烧之两头，以器承取沥汁，饮之。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-a8cn58b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-a8cn58b","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主不睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-drvdmtl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-drvdmtl","updated":"20240717095140"}},{"ID":"20240717095137-bd4okjz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-bd4okjz","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-qr2hq5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-qr2hq5l","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即俗所谓黄荆条。非蔓荆也。处处有之。其木心方。其枝对生。一枝五叶或七叶。如榆而长。尖边有锯齿。五月杪间。开红紫花成穗。子如胡荽而有白膜裹之。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-ta8ll0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-ta8ll0f","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎叶"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-nuw1ola","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-nuw1ola","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦。气寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-g0xl2r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-g0xl2r4","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附方九窍出血。荆叶捣汁。酒和。服二合。腰脚风湿痛不止。用荆茎于坛中烧烟。熏涌泉穴及痛处。使汗出则愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-6i4k7u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-6i4k7u9","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荆沥"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-a56zmej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-a56zmej","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘平。去心闷烦热。头昏旋晕目眩。心头洋洋欲吐。卒失音。小儿心热惊痫。止消渴。除痰唾。令人不睡。治心风为第一。（贞白）化痰去风为妙药。凡患风人多热。常宜以竹沥荆沥姜汁合五合。和匀热服。以瘥为度。（濒湖）二汁同功。并以姜汁助送则不凝滞。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-sbc12uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-sbc12uj","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但气虚不能食者。用竹沥。气实能食者。用荆沥。（丹溪）心虚惊悸羸瘦者。荆沥二升。煎至一升六合。分作四合。日三夜一。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-i5rw4df","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-i5rw4df","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕牡荆汁冷而甜。丹溪故谓气实能食者用荆沥。参之荆叶治九窍出血。则此味似能于阳中守阴。所以治心风推为第一。更观心虚惊悸一方。即知其有合于离中之坎。而守其取沥法用新采荆茎。截数尺长。加于两砖上。烧其中间。以器两头承取。热服。又法截三四寸长束入瓶中。仍以一瓶合住。固其外。糠火煨烧。其汁沥入下瓶中。亦妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-b2g30v3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-b2g30v3","updated":"20240717095140"}},{"ID":"20240717095137-vpfm1bp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-vpfm1bp","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆实《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-sl060rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-sl060rr","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感仲夏之气出土，故其味苦，气温，无毒。入足阳明经、厥阴经。其温能通行散邪，所以为去寒热止咳逆下肺气之需也。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-k4qll5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-k4qll5a","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆实，有青黄两种、人药惟青可用。八月采实晒干，临用炒黄研碎，下肺气止咳逆咽喉，通胃气除寒热骨节，通神见鬼，又载仙方，得柏实青葙，疗头风甚验。叶主脚气肿满， 湿疮霍乱，转筋无淋血痢。根煎服驱头面肢体诸风，解肌发汗。又有荆沥，如取竹沥同法，姜汁匀服，消痰末如神，治老人中风，失音昏危。小儿发热惊痫抽搐，气实能食者宜服，气虚少食者忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-v9t6xfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-v9t6xfe","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丹溪云∶虚痰用竹沥，实痰用荆沥，二味俱开经络，行血气要药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-05cy8es","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-05cy8es","updated":"20240717095140"}},{"ID":"20240717095137-c1x63pr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-c1x63pr","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆实《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-hmlvo85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-hmlvo85","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、温、无毒。主除骨间寒热，通利胃气，止咳逆，下气。生河间南阳宛朐山谷，或平寿、都乡高堤岸上，牡荆生田野。八月、九月采实，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-fmycrow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-fmycrow","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得术、柏实、青葙共疗头风，防风为之使，恶石膏。河间、宛朐、平寿并在北，南阳在西，论蔓荆，即应是今作杖棰之荆，而复非见。其子殊细，正如小麻子，色青黄。荆子实小大如乌豆大，正圆黑，仙术多用牡荆，今人都无识之者。李当之《药录》乃注溲疏下云∶溲疏一名阳胪，一名牡荆，一名空疏。皮白，中空，时有节。子似枸杞子，赤色，味甘、苦，冬月熟，俗乃无识者。当此实是真，非人篱域阳胪也。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-pzz1yty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-pzz1yty","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案如此说，溲都不同，其形类乖异，恐乖实理。而仙方用牡荆，云能通神见鬼，非唯其实，乃枝叶并好。又云有荆树，必枝枝相对，此是牡荆，有不对者，既非牡荆。既为父，则不应有子。如此，并莫详虚实，须更博访，乃详之耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-j3api7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-j3api7g","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此即作棰杖荆，是也。实细，黄黑色，茎劲作树，不为蔓生，故称之为牡，非无实之谓也。案《汉书·郊祀志》，以牡荆茎为幡竿，此明则蔓不堪为竿。今所在皆有，此荆非《本经》所载。案今生出乃是蔓荆，将以附此条后，陶为误矣。《别录》云∶荆叶，味苦，平，无毒。主久痢、霍乱、转筋、血淋，下部疮湿KT 。薄脚，主香港脚肿满。其根，味甘、苦，平，无毒。水煮服，主心风、头风、肢体诸风，解肌发汗。有青赤二种，赤者为佳。出《类聚方》，今医相承，多以牡荆为蔓荆，此极误也。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-nwwzxht","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-nwwzxht","updated":"20240717095140"}},{"ID":"20240717095137-b5hh55c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-b5hh55c","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆实《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-i6x41ta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-i6x41ta","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温，无毒。主除骨间寒热，通利胃气，止咳逆下气。生河间南阳、冤句山谷，或平寿都乡高岸上及田野中，八月九月采实阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-uinotp2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-uinotp2","updated":"20240717095140"}},{"ID":"20240717095137-zyr3fyx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-zyr3fyx","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆实《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-5kj28r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-5kj28r4","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温，无毒．主除骨间寒热，通利胃气，止咳逆，下气．生河间南阳宛朐山谷平寿、都乡高堤岸上，牡荆生田野．八月、九月采实，阴干．（得术、柏实、青葙共治防风为之使，恶石膏．）"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-qtbo8ea","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-qtbo8ea","updated":"20240717095140"}},{"ID":"20240717095137-5efw43e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-5efw43e","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-29sx6v0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-29sx6v0","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」黄荆、小荆、楚。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-2go6nvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-2go6nvy","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」实：苦、温、无毒。叶：苦、寒、无毒。根：甘、若、平、无毒。茎：甘、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-i8ak7xb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-i8ak7xb","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-etc90el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-etc90el","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、白带下。用牡荆子炒焦为末，饮服。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-kw6uacv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-kw6uacv","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小肠疝气。用牡荆子半升，炒熟，加酒一碗，煎开，乘热饮服。甚效。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-kmh2viu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-kmh2viu","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、湿痰白浊。用牡荆子炒为末，每服三钱，酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-421qldj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-421qldj","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、耳聋。用牡荆子泡酒常饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-8z1vbmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-8z1vbmi","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶："}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-i9rm2i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-i9rm2i6","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、九窍出血。用荆叶捣汁，酒调服二合。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-j1bi695","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-j1bi695","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小便尿血。治方同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-1b7t0su","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-1b7t0su","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、腰脚风湿。用荆叶煮水，熏蒸病人，以汗出为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-4t1r3i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-4t1r3i4","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根："}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-rfxmnky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-rfxmnky","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各上风疾。用七叶黄荆根皮、五加根皮、接骨草，等分煎汤，每日饮服适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-ein7lkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-ein7lkr","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎："}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-5lwewpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-5lwewpw","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"灼疮发热，风牙痛。青盲内障。荆沥："}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-jpupt91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-jpupt91","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、中风口噤。服荆沥，每次一升。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-qqeu788","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-qqeu788","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、头风头痛。用日取荆沥饮服。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-4e6ogjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-4e6ogjm","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、喉痹疮肿。取荆沥细细咽服。或以荆一把，水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-muqc1k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-muqc1k7","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、心虚惊悸，形容枯瘦。用荆沥二升，火上煎成一升六合，分四次服，白天服三次，晚上服一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-dx0mx3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-dx0mx3p","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、赤白痢。久不愈。用荆沥饮服，每日五合。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095137-fvb2ee7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717095137-fvb2ee7","updated":"20240717095140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、疮癣。用荆沥涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240717095138-7depz5f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717095138-7depz5f"}},{"ID":"20240902102809-1nyh0xv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-1nyh0xv","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中草药：牡荆叶"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-g7b0btd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-g7b0btd","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆叶《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-71oparg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-71oparg","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MǔJīnɡYè"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-ye4qlzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-ye4qlzf","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FOLIUMVITICISNEGUNDO"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-atgi2lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-atgi2lb","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为马鞭草科植物牡荆VitexnegundoL.var.cannabifolia（Sieb.etZucc.）Hand.-Mazz.的新鲜叶。夏、秋二季叶茂盛时采收，除去茎枝。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-wia05ak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-wia05ak","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品为掌状复叶，小叶5片或3片，披针形或椭圆状披针形，中间小叶长5～10cm，宽2～4cm，两侧小叶依次渐小，先端渐尖，基部楔形，边缘具粗锯齿；上表面绿色，下表面淡绿色，两面沿叶脉有短茸毛，嫩叶下表面毛较密；总叶柄长2～6cm，有一浅沟槽，密被灰白色茸毛。气芳香，味辛微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-5i2kuzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-5i2kuzo","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-7h7nkat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-7h7nkat","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品横切面：上表皮细胞排列较整齐，上、下表面均有毛茸，下表面毛茸较多。叶肉栅栏组织为3～4列细胞，海绵组织较疏松。主脉维管束外韧型，呈月牙形或“Ｕ”字形，“Ｕ”形的凹部另有1～5个较小的维管束，周围薄壁细胞可见纹孔；上、下表皮内方有数列厚角细胞。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-qhyhu8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-qhyhu8i","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品表面观：上表皮细胞呈类多角形或不规则形，垂周壁波状弯曲；非腺毛1～4细胞，先端细胞较长，表面有疣状突起；腺鳞头部4细胞，直径约至55μｍ，柄单细胞；小腺毛少见，头部1～4细胞，直径约至25μｍ，柄1～3细胞，甚短。下表皮细胞较小，长17～30（45）μｍ，直径12～25μｍ，垂周壁微弯曲或较平直；气孔类圆形，直径15～20μｍ，副卫细胞3～6个，不定式；非腺毛、腺鳞和小腺毛较多。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-ott90tq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-ott90tq","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】微苦、辛，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-4vxgmxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-4vxgmxn","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-yjxuh4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-yjxuh4d","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛痰，止咳，平喘。用于咳喘；慢性支气管炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-nocgxys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-nocgxys","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】鲜用，供提取牡荆油用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-wiwz6kh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-wiwz6kh","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-qxpkq1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-qxpkq1v","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-5w1ict9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-5w1ict9","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆叶《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-mu69cc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-mu69cc6","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-brx4rb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-brx4rb7","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MǔJīnɡYè"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-gz6fo5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-gz6fo5t","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为马鞭草科植物牡荆的叶片。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-88li95w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-88li95w","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-0dh8ddb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-0dh8ddb","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-8n0shpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-8n0shpb","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"味苦，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-xjj1hoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-xjj1hoe","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"苦，寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-6ln4nst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-6ln4nst","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-9y4n1yo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-9y4n1yo","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"祛风解表，除湿，杀虫，止痛。治风寒感冒，痧气腹痛吐泻，痢疾，风湿痛：脚气，流火，痈肿，足癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-8zr59km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-8zr59km","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"主久痢，霍乱转筋，血淋，下部疮，湿匿薄脚，主脚气肿满。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-r0wyjs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-r0wyjs2","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《福建中草药》：\"祛风解表，调气和胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-hjocsro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-hjocsro","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3～5钱（鲜者1～2两）；或捣汁，外用：捣敷或煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-ophchmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-ophchmy","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-pfshmc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-pfshmc5","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治风寒感冒：鲜牡荆叶八钱，或加紫苏鲜叶四钱。水煎服。（《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-fko6038","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-fko6038","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②预防中暑：牡荆干嫩叶二至三钱。水煎代茶饮。（《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-gzmg6x4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-gzmg6x4","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治痧气腹痛及胃痛：鲜牡荆叶二十片，放口中，嚼烂咽汁。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-kquer4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-kquer4i","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治急性胃肠炎：牡荆鲜茎叶一至二两。水煎服。（《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-avesh52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-avesh52","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治久痢不愈：牡荆鲜茎叶五至八钱，和冰糖，冲开水炖一小时，饭前服，日二次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-jzdk1wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-jzdk1wa","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小便出血：捣荆叶取汁，酒服二合。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-utjotry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-utjotry","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治腰脚风湿痛不止：荆叶不限多少，蒸置大瓮中，其下着火温之，以病人置叶中，须臾当汗出。蒸时，常旋旋吃饭，稍倦即止，便以被盖避风，仍进葱豉酒及豆酒亦可，以瘥为度。（《海上集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-ytvet8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-ytvet8z","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治脚气肿胀：牡荆茎叶二两，丝瓜络七钱，紫苏七钱，水菖蒲根七钱，艾叶七钱。水煎熏洗。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-ekn5geo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-ekn5geo","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治血丝虫病急性期，怕冷发热，肢体起红线或片状红肿（流火）：青蒿一两，牡荆叶五钱，威灵仙五钱。水煎服，一日一服。（徐州《单方验方新医疗法选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-pq4f297","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-pq4f297","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治乳痈初起：牡荆茎叶八钱。酒水各半煎服。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-gjwmb1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-gjwmb1t","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治乳肿：牡荆叶，擂酒敷。（《医学入门》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-0un6eqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-0un6eqa","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治风疹：牡荆干叶三至五钱。水煎服；或另用叶煎汤熏洗。（《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-ih0cx8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-ih0cx8n","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治足癣：牡荆鲜叶、马尾松鲜叶、油茶子饼各等量。煎汤熏洗患处。（《福建中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-zdzucce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-zdzucce","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治脚趾缝湿痒：牡荆叶杵烂，塞患处；或煎水熏洗。（《江西民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-oyu59l5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-oyu59l5","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治钢铁烫伤：牡荆叶、金樱子叶，炒干研末，浓茶调敷。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-v5p92bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-v5p92bw","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-g97n7bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-g97n7bl","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治疗头癣"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-tr98v2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-tr98v2l","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取鲜牡荆叶1斤，加开水2斤，浸泡15分钟后过滤，用滤液洗头5～8分钟，每日1次；或用鲜叶半斤捣烂，涂擦患处。每日2次。洗擦后头部用布包扎。一般洗擦4天后头皮痒感消失，脓疱、糠皮状鳞屑减少，2个月后长发。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-71y1vcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-71y1vcw","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗脚癣"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-jmhk1hz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-jmhk1hz","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取牡荆叶半斤，置面盆中，加开水以浸没药面为度，浸泡至水呈浅绿色时，加温水到半面盆；然后将两脚浸于药液中5～6分钟，擦干。每晚睡前1次，一般浸洗5～6次后即可痒止而愈。亦可用鲜牡荆叶直接涂擦于患部，每日1～2次，同样有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-bt98nr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-bt98nr2","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-t8fdbvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-t8fdbvd","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡荆叶《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-ioozpff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-ioozpff","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《名医别录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-m26dbld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-m26dbld","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MǔJīnɡYè"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-gxnuvjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-gxnuvjj","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】HempleafNegundoChastetreeLeaf，LeafofHempleafNegundoChastetree"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-nzh8s28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-nzh8s28","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】荆叶"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-byzlmcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-byzlmcd","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-7ot86r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-7ot86r8","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为马鞭草科植物牡荆的叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-h3uvtwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-h3uvtwf","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：VitexnegundoL.Var.cannabifolia(Sieb.EtZucc.)Hand.-Mazz."}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-v5ux2rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-v5ux2rt","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：生长季节均可采收，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-gdh7u93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-gdh7u93","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】牡荆，落叶灌木或小乔木，植株高1-5m。多分枝，具香味。小枝四棱形，绿色，被粗毛，老枝褐色，圆形。掌状复叶，对生；小叶5，稀为3，中间1枚最大；叶片披针形或椭圆状披针形，基部楔形，边缘具粗锯齿，先端渐尖，表面绿色，背面淡绿色，通常被柔毛。圆锥花序顶生，长10-20cm；花萼钟状，先端5齿裂；花冠淡紫色，先端5裂，二唇形。果实球形，黑色。花、果期7-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-sgj7fms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-sgj7fms","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-2z51amp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-2z51amp","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于低山向阳的山坡路边或灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-lkc634n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-lkc634n","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于华东及河北、湖南、湖北、广东、广西、四川、贵州。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-nkq7aqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-nkq7aqq","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别掌状复叶多皱缩、卷贡，展平后小叶3-5枚，中间3小叶披针形，长6-10cm，宽2-5cm，基部楔形，先端长尖，边缘有粗锯齿；两侧小叶略小，卵状披针形。上表面灰褐色或黄褐色，下表面黄褐色，被稀疏毛。羽状叶脉于背面隆起。总叶柄长3-8cm，密被黄色细毛。气特异，味微苦。以色绿、香气浓者为佳。显微鉴别叶横切面：上、下表皮细胞各1列，长方形，外侧平周壁稍呈角质化；叶肉组织为不等面型，栅栏细胞2列，于中脉处中断；中脉下方突起，上下表皮内侧均有数列厚角细胞，维管束呈“V”字形，外韧型。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-cefw65q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-cefw65q","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】牡荆叶含挥发油约0.1%，其中主成分为β-丁香烯（β-caryophyllene），含量达44.94%，其次为香桧烯（sabinene），含量10.09%，还含α-侧柏烯（α-thujene）α-及β-蒎烯（pinene），樟烯（camphene），月桂烯（myrcene），α-水芹烯（α-phellandrene），对-聚伞花素（p-cymene），柠檬烯（limonene），1，8-桉叶素（1，8-cineole），α-及γ-松油烯（terpinene），异松油烯（terpinolene），蓄谋检疫站醇（linalool），4-松油烯醇（terpinen-4-ol），α-松油醇（α-terpineol），乙酸龙脑酯（bornylacetate），乙酸橙花醇酯（merylacetate），β-及δ-榄香烯（elelmene），乙酸松油醇酯（terpinylacetate），玷(王巴)（copaene），β-波旁烯（β-bourbonene），葎草烯（humulene），γ-前兰油烯（γ-muurolene），β-荜澄茄油烯（β-cubebene），佛术烯（eremophilene），β-甜没药烯（β-bisabolene），δ-荜澄茄烯（δ-cadinene），菖蒲烯（calamenene），丁香烯氧化物（caryophylleneoxide），β-桉叶醇（β-eudesmol）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-lnrkj0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-lnrkj0k","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】1.祛痰作用牡荆叶挥发油1.04g/kg和1.73g/kg灌胃，小鼠酚红法实验表明有显着祛痰作用。此作用主要通过迷走神经，切断迷走神经后祛痰作用减弱。给小鼠灌服或注射牡荆煎剂或粗提牡荆黄酮甙后，可由肺部排出，其祛痰作用也可能与此相关。也有认为牡荆叶的祛痰作用，与其减少痰液内酸性粘多糖纤维和促进其裂解有关。2.镇咳作用牡荆叶油1.04g/kg灌胃，对氨水喷雾引咳的小鼠有显着镇咳作用，0.52g/kg时作用较弱。粗提牡荆黄酮甙静注能抑制电刺激麻醉猫喉上神经所致的咳嗽，其作用强度随剂量增加而增强，表明其镇咳作用与抑制咳嗽中枢有关。3.平喘作用豚鼠恒压组胺喷雾法试验表明，牡荆叶油乳剂1g/kg灌服，能明显延长组胺IV级反应开始时间，半减少IV级反应发作鼠数，表明有一定平喘作用；离体气管法试验，牡荆叶油也有一定抗组胺作用。4.降血压作用牡荆叶油乳剂100mg/kg十二指肠给药1h后兔血压平均下降31%，持续2h；牡荆叶油石油醚洗脱物5mg/kg和10mg/kg静脉注射，血压会别下降23%和39%。牡荆叶油的降压作用不受乙酰胆碱、阿托品或切断迷走神经影响表明与胆碱能神经无直接关系。5.对机体免疫功能的影响牡荆挥发油0.35ml/（kg·d）灌胃，连续6d，有增强腹腔巨噬细胞对鸡红细胞吞噬作用的趋势。牡荆叶油主成分丁香烯能增加血清IgG水平，表明有增强体液免疫的作用。另有报道，牡荆叶油大剂量（1/8LD50）灌胃，能降低网状内皮系统对炭粒的吞噬能力。牡荆叶油对巨噬细胞吞噬功能低下的慢性气管炎患者，能使巨噬细胞的吞噬率、吞噬指数和消化程度显着提高，使之接近正常人水平。6.对血清蛋白的调切作用给慢性气管炎病人每日口服β-丁香烯30mg（A组）、牡荆叶挥发油低沸点部分30mg（B组）、牡荆叶挥发油50mg（北方组和南方组），连续20d。结果A组γ-球蛋白明显回升；B组血清清蛋白回升，α2-球蛋白回降；北方组除β球蛋白外，其他蛋白成分，偏低者回升，偏高者回降，但均不显着；南方组清蛋白回升，β-和γ-球蛋白回降，α1-和α2-球蛋白下降。表明牡荆叶挥发油能使清蛋白回升，对γ-、β-和α-球蛋白有双向调节作用，表明有促进清蛋白合成和调节免疫球蛋白作用。7.镇静催眠作用小鼠灌服牡荆叶油30min后能显着延长腹腔注射戊巴比妥钠40mg/kg所致催眠作用时间，也能增加腹腔注射阈下剂量（30mg/kg）引起催眠小鼠只数，表明有一定镇静催眠作用。8.抗菌作用牡荆茎叶水煎剂在体外对金黄色葡萄球菌和炭疽杆菌有显着抗菌作用，对大肠杆菌、乙型链球菌、白喉杆菌、伤寒杆菌、绿脓肝菌和痢疾杆菌等也有一定抗菌作用。9.其他作用牡荆叶油对离体豚鼠回肠有显显的抗组胺作用。牡荆叶油乳剂1/8LD50灌胃可使幼鼠胸腺明显萎缩，表明可能有增强肾上腺皮质功能的作用。10.毒性①急性毒性试验：牡荆叶挥发油小鼠灌胃的LD50为7.40g/kg或8.68g/kg；牡荆叶挥发油乳剂小鼠灌胃的LD50为5.20g/kg，腹腔注射为0.34g/kg。②亚急性毒性试验：小鼠口服牡荆叶挥发油1/10和1/20LD50，连续14d，全部存活，体重及主要器官的形态和组织学检查均未见异常。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-at5kwfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-at5kwfx","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】牡荆叶油灌服，对小鼠的LD50分别为8.68±0.41ml/kg及9.6ml/kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-63nnsro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-63nnsro","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别取本品粉末1g，用石油醚脱脂，滤过，残渣加乙醇10ml，浸泡过夜，滤过。滤液浓缩至1ml。于2支试管中各加浓缩液2滴，再分别加入盐酸-镁粉、盐酸-锌粉试剂，依次显现橙黄色和樱红色。（检查黄酮）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-k1t5qpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-k1t5qpq","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；苦；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-cs871vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-cs871vn","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】解表化湿，祛痰平喘；解毒。主伤风感冒，咳嗽哮喘；胃痛；腹痛；暑湿泻痢；脚气肿胀；风疹瘙痒；脚癣；乳痈肿痛；蛇虫咬伤"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-goyler7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-goyler7","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤9-15g，鲜者可爱和至30-60g；或捣汁饮。外用：适量，捣敷；或煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-d97hl8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-d97hl8m","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-aqyeppn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-aqyeppn","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《名医别录》：主久痢，霍乱转筋，血淋，下部疮，脚气肿满。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-4fedwg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-4fedwg5","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《福建中草药》：祛风解表，调气和胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102809-1vs9v4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102809-1vs9v4z","updated":"20240902102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102810-eish6zm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902102810-eish6zm","updated":"20240902102809"}},{"ID":"20240902102811-47plm3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102811-47plm3n","updated":"20240902102809"}}]}